  m_Name: MCQ_009
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MCQQuestionData
  questionText: Select the events in spermatogenesis.
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: Primary spermatocytes undergo meiosis I to form secondary spermatocytes
    which further undergo meiosis II to form the spermatids.
  options:
  - In spermatogenesis, each meiotic division is equal.
  - The first division gives rise to two secondary spermatocytes.
  - The second meiotic division then gives four spermatids.
  - All of the above
  correctOptionIndex: 3
